Bug: 515039631
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX

TAG=agy
CONV=9a527269-d864-49a9-8dd6-1fffebca18ec
Cherrypick-From: https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:5a6da90eafbffaa512795292791bf880e95e216f
